# Where shapebit-packaging installed ShapeBit's package macros and license
# texts, which a spec loads with %{load:%{shapebit_macros}}. Only these paths
# are defined for every build here: the macros themselves apply only to the
# specs that load them.
%shapebit_macros    /usr/share/shapebit/packaging/package.macros
%shapebit_licenses  /usr/share/shapebit/packaging/licenses
